Material from Emu8086

The MIT License above does not apply to the following.

* examples/ - all files except hello_nasm.asm and boot_nasm.asm are the example
  programs shipped with Emu8086 (the 8086 microprocessor emulator formerly
  published at emu8086.com; the website and the company no longer exist),
  included unchanged except for the character encoding of thermometer.asm.
  They belong to the authors of Emu8086.

* crates/rustemu-asm/inc/emu8086.inc reproduces the emu8086.inc library of
  Emu8086: its macros and procedures, their names, parameters and behaviour
  belong to the authors of Emu8086. The text of the file was written for
  RustEmu8086.
